PTX CoRR+mmio
"Read-read coherence for mmio accesses: strong and morally strong, so SC per location holds (8.10.5). Expected: forbidden."
{
x=0;
P1:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,gpu 0                  | P1@cta 1,gpu 0                   ;
 st.mmio.relaxed.sys.global x, 1 | ld.mmio.relaxed.sys.global r0, x ;
                                 | ld.mmio.relaxed.sys.global r1, x ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 1 /\ P1:r1 == 0)
